  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Pick one route, finish one project and show it to two people in the field. Then read ten live notices and apply or pitch a small client.
  </p>
  <p>
    A specialist can look at your strengths, finances and goals with you. A sensible first step is <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/student-career-guidance/">student career guidance</a>. The aim is a high-income skill portfolio and an earlier path to financial freedom.
  </p>

  <p>
    For routes, a budget check and a twelve-week plan, read <a href="/blog/career-change/switching-from-business-or-commerce-to-science-or-healthcare-india/">switching from business or commerce to science or healthcare</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For a comparison and a twelve-week test plan, read <a href="/blog/career-guidance/management-vs-technology-career-path-how-to-choose-india/">management vs technology career path</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For causes, options and a twelve-week plan, read <a href="/blog/career-change/stuck-after-an-mba-what-to-do-when-the-career-has-not-moved-india/">being stuck after an MBA</a>.
  </p>

